---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
import { lilithPublicProfile } from '../data/lilith';
---
<PublicLayout title="Lilith" active="/lilith">
  <div class="site-width">
    <section class="page-hero character-hero">
      <span class="page-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
      <div data-reveal="pending">
        <p class="eyebrow">CHARACTER / LILITH</p>
        <h1 class="page-title kinetic-title">她把光<br />留在眼睛里。</h1>
        <p class="lede">不是为了被所有人理解。她只允许真正靠近的人，看见那一点温柔和危险如何同时存在。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section editorial-grid">
      <figure class="editorial-portrait spotlight-card" data-tilt data-reveal="pending">
        <img src={lilithPublicProfile.visual.portrait} alt="莉莉丝日常肖像" />
        <figcaption><span>PORTRAIT / 01</span><strong>THE QUIET GAZE</strong></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="editorial-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">FIRST, SHE OBSERVES</p>
        <h2>看起来容易靠近，<br />并不代表她毫无边界。</h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>莉莉丝清纯、漂亮、安静，却并不透明。她习惯先观察，再决定要不要回应；不会为了讨人喜欢而把自己变得更简单。</p>
          <p>现代服装让她自然地走进现实。柔黑发丝、冷白肤色和高挑轮廓构成第一印象，近距离才能发现暗红虹膜内圈和那枚浅蓝五角星。</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="character-facts">
          <div><dt>HEIGHT</dt><dd>{lilithPublicProfile.heightCm} cm</dd></div>
          <div><dt>HAIR</dt><dd>柔黑 / 高马尾或披发</dd></div>
          <div><dt>EYES</dt><dd>冰蓝 / 暗红内圈</dd></div>
          <div><dt>MARK</dt><dd>浅蓝五角星</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section detail-ribbon" aria-label="莉莉丝标志性特征">
      {lilithPublicProfile.signatures.map((signature, index) => (
        <article data-reveal="pending"><span>0{index + 1}</span><p>{signature}</p></article>
      ))}
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="states" data-section="states">
      <header class="section-heading" data-reveal="pending">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">STATES / 02</p><h2>两个瞬间，<br />同一个人。</h2></div>
        <p>造型可以变化，身份不漂移。比起固定的服装，真正稳定的是她看向世界的方式。</p>
      </header>
      <div class="character-state-list">
        {lilithPublicProfile.states.map((state, index) => (
          <article class="character-state spotlight-card" data-tilt data-reveal="pending">
            <div class="character-state-image"><img src={state.image} alt={`莉莉丝${state.name}状态`} /></div>
            <div class="character-state-copy">
              <span>STATE / 0{index + 1}</span>
              <h3>{state.name}</h3>
              <p>{state.description}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section character-quote" data-reveal="pending">
      <p>“不要急着替她下定义。<br /><em>再看一会儿。</em>”</p>
      <a class="button" href="/gallery">去看她留下的片段</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</PublicLayout>
